#: buildVars.py:35
msgid "A translation add-on for NVDA with support for multiple engines."
msgstr "支持多种引擎的 NVDA 翻译插件。"

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:40
msgid ""
"### 1.3.2\n"
"\n"
"- Added LibreTranslate support for self-hosted servers, with a configurable "
"server URL and optional API key.\n"
"- Improved command-layer interaction: run commands consecutively, press "
"`Escape` to exit, or use an unrelated gesture to return to NVDA or the "
"active application. Braille displays now show the layer status and help "
"hint.\n"
"- Improved the Ukrainian localization."
msgstr ""
"### 1.3.2\n"
"\n"
"- 新增 LibreTranslate 支持，可连接自托管服务器，并可配置服务器 URL 和可选 API 密钥。\n"
"- 改进命令层交互：可连续执行命令；按 `Escape` 退出；使用其他手势时返回 NVDA 或当前应用程序。盲文点显器现在会显示命令层状态和帮助提示。\n"
"- 改进乌克兰语本地化。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "### 1.3.0\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "- Added Windows DPAPI protection for engine credentials, so saved "
#~ "credentials are no longer stored in plaintext and portable profiles must "
#~ "be reconfigured when moved to another machine."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "### 1.3.0\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "- 已为引擎凭据启用 Windows DPAPI 保护，因此已保存的凭据不再以明文存储，便"
#~ "携配置移到其他电脑后需要重新配置。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "### 1.2.1\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "- Improved the Simplified Chinese and Ukrainian localizations and aligned "
#~ "the English and Simplified Chinese documentation.\n"
#~ "- Removed unused internal code and obsolete comments."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "### 1.2.1\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "- 完善了简体中文和乌克兰语本地化，并统一了英文和简体中文文档的表述。\n"
#~ "- 删除了未使用的内部代码和过期注释。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "### 1.2.0\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "- Added the key-free `DeepL Web` engine with automatic source detection, "
#~ "regional language options, and support for requests up to 1,500 "
#~ "characters.\n"
#~ "- Migrated key-free Microsoft Translator to the current Edge "
#~ "`translatetext` endpoint and removed the retired authentication-token "
#~ "flow.\n"
#~ "- Refreshed OpenRouter presets with current translation-specialised "
#~ "Tencent and Gemini Flash Lite models, automatic fallback for retired "
#~ "presets, and prompt options matched to model capabilities.\n"
#~ "- Reused HTTP connections across translation requests to reduce latency "
#~ "for repeated translations.\n"
#~ "- Removed the unavailable Lingva Translate engine.\n"
#~ "- Fixed long labels overflowing the Chrome AI and Common Settings panels."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "### 1.2.0\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "- 新增免密钥 `DeepL Web` 引擎，支持自动检测源语言、地区语言选项，以及每次"
#~ "最多 1,500 个字符的请求。\n"
#~ "- 将免密钥微软翻译迁移到当前的 Edge `translatetext` 端点，并移除已停用的认"
#~ "证令牌流程。\n"
#~ "- 更新 OpenRouter 预设，采用当前的腾讯翻译专用模型和 Gemini Flash Lite 模"
#~ "型；为已下线预设提供自动回退，并根据模型能力提供匹配的提示词选项。\n"
#~ "- 在翻译请求间复用 HTTP 连接，降低重复翻译的延迟。\n"
#~ "- 移除不可用的 Lingva Translate 引擎。\n"
#~ "- 修复 Chrome AI 和通用设置面板中长标签溢出的问题。"
